  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> War sphere, bound nexus class feature.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You may expend a soul from your bound nexus to create a bound totemic soul. A totemic soul works as a normal totem, but it can move as if it were a soul (they normally orbit the character, but the soul weaver can move any number of them as a free action once per round and they have a fly speed of 40 feet), and it has a radius of only 30 feet. A totemic soul continues to exist for 10 minutes per level in the class that grants you the bound nexus class feature without needing concentration. You must still pay the normal spell point cost for creating the totem.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/soul-weaver#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
